sequenceDiagram
    participant Reminder Service
    participant NATS Server
    participant Notification Service

    Note over Notification Service: Subscribes to 'reminder.trigger' on startup
    Notification Service->>NATS Server: SUBSCRIBE('reminder.trigger')

    Note over Reminder Service: User creates a reminder
    Reminder Service->>NATS Server: PUBLISH('reminder.trigger', payload)
    NATS Server->>Notification Service: DELIVER(payload)

    Note over Notification Service: onReminder(payload) is executed
    Notification Service->>Notification Service: handleReminder(payload)